{"3598280": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Durga : The Lionhearted", "steam_appid": 3598280, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598280/extras/58cf1e7385cbe6b1f9161b0343229bc7.avif?t=1784963809\" width=450 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598280/extras/a4ebd1261b216f0acfa358e85dd6c3a9.poster.avif?t=1784963809\" width=512 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598280/extras/a4ebd1261b216f0acfa358e85dd6c3a9.webm?t=1784963809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598280/extras/a4ebd1261b216f0acfa358e85dd6c3a9.mp4?t=1784963809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as <strong>Durga</strong>, a brave teenage girl from a forgotten village, as she embarks on a dangerous journey deep into ancient Indian forests. Inspired by epic tales from the Puranas, this story-driven adventure blends <strong>exploration, combat, and puzzle-solving</strong> into a cinematic experience where every choice matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598280/extras/f8e1e735292815ee8e3b7745857bc1d9.avif?t=1784963809\" width=512 height=64 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Animal Encounters</strong> – Outsmart and fight wild beasts like a massive cursed lion in thrilling, cinematic combat sequences.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Myth Meets Mystery</strong> – Discover ancient carvings, lost rituals, and forgotten deities hidden in overgrown temples.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598280/extras/8dee129b593a4112d65624bb912139fa.poster.avif?t=1784963809\" width=512 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598280/extras/8dee129b593a4112d65624bb912139fa.webm?t=1784963809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598280/extras/8dee129b593a4112d65624bb912139fa.mp4?t=1784963809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Survive the Jungle</strong> – Gather herbs, craft remedies, and use nature’s gifts to heal or calm enraged animals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve Mythical Puzzles</strong> – Unlock paths by choosing between forces of Dharma and Adharma, just like the heroes of old epics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Journey of Spirit</strong> – Witness Durga grow from a courageous villager to the guardian of an ancient legacy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598280/extras/30e2c6f54994a1e3ac85f1ec2cb893ad.poster.avif?t=1784963809\" width=512 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598280/extras/30e2c6f54994a1e3ac85f1ec2cb893ad.webm?t=1784963809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598280/extras/30e2c6f54994a1e3ac85f1ec2cb893ad.mp4?t=1784963809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you guide Durga to embrace her fate and revive the lost ancient tales?</strong> The journey begins now! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598280/extras/447241ef82bc04c4a1874907c369025e.avif?t=1784963809\" width=512 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">For the latest updates on Durga’s journey! </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598280/extras/58cf1e7385cbe6b1f9161b0343229bc7.avif?t=1784963809\" width=450 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598280/extras/a4ebd1261b216f0acfa358e85dd6c3a9.poster.avif?t=1784963809\" width=512 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598280/extras/a4ebd1261b216f0acfa358e85dd6c3a9.webm?t=1784963809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598280/extras/a4ebd1261b216f0acfa358e85dd6c3a9.mp4?t=1784963809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as <strong>Durga</strong>, a brave teenage girl from a forgotten village, as she embarks on a dangerous journey deep into ancient Indian forests. Inspired by epic tales from the Puranas, this story-driven adventure blends <strong>exploration, combat, and puzzle-solving</strong> into a cinematic experience where every choice matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598280/extras/f8e1e735292815ee8e3b7745857bc1d9.avif?t=1784963809\" width=512 height=64 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Animal Encounters</strong> – Outsmart and fight wild beasts like a massive cursed lion in thrilling, cinematic combat sequences.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Myth Meets Mystery</strong> – Discover ancient carvings, lost rituals, and forgotten deities hidden in overgrown temples.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598280/extras/8dee129b593a4112d65624bb912139fa.poster.avif?t=1784963809\" width=512 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598280/extras/8dee129b593a4112d65624bb912139fa.webm?t=1784963809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598280/extras/8dee129b593a4112d65624bb912139fa.mp4?t=1784963809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Survive the Jungle</strong> – Gather herbs, craft remedies, and use nature’s gifts to heal or calm enraged animals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve Mythical Puzzles</strong> – Unlock paths by choosing between forces of Dharma and Adharma, just like the heroes of old epics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Journey of Spirit</strong> – Witness Durga grow from a courageous villager to the guardian of an ancient legacy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><vi